Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.70,1:47:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.26,1:47:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.64,1:47:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.30,1:47:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.50,1:47:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.30,1:47:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.18,1:47:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只用嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.88,1:47:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.20,1:47:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.08,1:47:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,注意到了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.72,1:48:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的时候别削掉肉
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.34,1:48:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不用手的话就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.26,1:48:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,太悲伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.32,1:48:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 这抽动的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.16,1:48:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.08,1:48:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我想说
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.08,1:48:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.10,1:48:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.02,1:48:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把压力释放出来...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.68,1:48:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.54,1:48:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想要下雨...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.82,1:48:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要猫咪和老虎...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.74,1:48:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"想看看那时候单纯的样子"
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.90,1:48:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定不想
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.84,1:48:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.68,1:49:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.80,1:49:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.56,1:49:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真不舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.10,1:50:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,磨得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.26,1:50:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.92,1:50:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.98,1:50:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的零食堆在一起...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.72,1:50:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.80,1:50:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...嗯...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.34,1:50:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.86,1:51:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...有点咸...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.84,1:51:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪个\N- 快要兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.74,1:51:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,共享一下
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.82,1:51:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.48,1:51:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,展示一下
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.92,1:51:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把手肘撑起来
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.86,1:51:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.76,1:51:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,靠这么近...被看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.54,1:51:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.12,1:51:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.80,1:51:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊~
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.02,1:51:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.80,1:52:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,腰要动起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.90,1:52:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,动吧
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.08,1:52:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好爽
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.02,1:52:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.28,1:52:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,乖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.64,1:52:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.48,1:52:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.28,1:52:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.12,1:52:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时先这样
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.40,1:52:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.32,1:53:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,变亮了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.56,1:53:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.08,1:53:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.16,1:53:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 躺下
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.94,1:53:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你也躺下
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.12,1:53:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,脚要分开
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.50,1:53:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.70,1:53:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.50,1:53:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.26,1:54:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.00,1:54:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.74,1:55:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.82,1:55:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再来点
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.06,1:55:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.06,1:55:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.54,1:57:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,再放进去
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.48,1:57:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太深了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.80,1:57:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.56,1:57:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.72,1:57:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.74,1:57:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.48,1:57:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.04,1:57:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.56,1:58:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被摊开了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.34,1:58:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.84,1:58:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,清晰可见
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.32,1:58:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.14,1:58:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.30,1:58:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.90,1:58:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.88,1:58:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.42,1:59:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.20,1:59:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.76,1:59:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.80,1:59:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.54,1:59:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,传来了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.06,1:59:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 要起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.94,1:59:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,起来了 不行 起来了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.00,2:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,摇晃一下
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.12,2:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.18,2:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.28,2:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.46,2:00:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,来了来了来了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.36,2:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.74,2:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,总想再来一次
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.30,2:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.56,2:01:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,满满的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.16,2:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.42,2:01:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.44,2:01:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在等你呢 看着你呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.62,2:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,全都看得到
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.38,2:01:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看得一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.64,2:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要做好准备了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.32,2:01:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,全都看得到哦
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.94,2:01:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.38,2:02:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,唔
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.92,2:02:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.80,2:02:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.48,2:02:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都给我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.94,2:02:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.36,2:03:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,全部给我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.80,2:03:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,都想要
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.38,2:03:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,低一点 低一点 低一点
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.88,2:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 不对哦哦哦哦
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.54,2:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.98,2:03:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,心跳声好大
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.86,2:03:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,全都出来了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.54,2:04:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,祝大家有美好的性生活
